            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una variabile di classe chiamata <code>retailers</code> che contenga un array di stringhe con i negozi dove puoi acquistare la fotocamera.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Camera\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value = \" /><text value=\"&quot;$800&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" model = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Canon EOS M6&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" retailers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Walmart&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eBay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Amazon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Best Buy&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let retailers</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>[</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
